<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia TCL debuts at 4.20 ringgit.</title>
<headline>Malaysia TCL debuts at 4.20 ringgit.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of TCL Premier Holdings Bhd made their debut at 4.20 ringgit against an offer price of 2.50.</p>
<p>The stockbroking concern offered 12.5 million shares to the public for its listing on the main board of the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.  </p>
<p>About 10 minutes into the opening, the stock was at 4.30 ringgit on the market's heaviest volume of 1.2 million shares.</p>
<p>TCL Premier has forecast gross earnings per share of 39.77 cents for the year ending December 31, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
